{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1366"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c114): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c114.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1366"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge geography/countries","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/geography__countries.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",764],["+","The coast is a fourth. Alaska also has the longest coastline of any state, by every way of measuring it: about 6,640 miles of general coastline, more than all the other states combined, and almost 34,000 miles of tidal shoreline once every bay, fjord and island is followed. Florida, with about 1,350 miles, comes a distant second, and California third.\n\nEven the names have their trivia. Exactly 4 states end in the letter o – Colorado, Idaho, New Mexico and Ohio – while far more end in a, from Alabama and Alaska to Pennsylvania and Virginia.\n\n"],["=",127],["+","\n| Longest coastline | Alaska | about 6,640 mi (general) |"],["=",110]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",732],["+","Die Küste ist ein vierter. Alaska hat auch die längste Küste aller Bundesstaaten, wie immer man sie misst: rund 6.640 Meilen allgemeine Küstenlinie, mehr als alle anderen Staaten zusammen, und fast 34.000 Meilen Gezeitenküste, wenn man jeder Bucht, jedem Fjord und jeder Insel folgt. Florida folgt mit rund 1.350 Meilen weit abgeschlagen auf Platz zwei, Kalifornien auf Platz drei.\n\nSelbst die Namen bieten Quizstoff. Genau 4 Bundesstaaten enden auf den Buchstaben o – Colorado, Idaho, New Mexico und Ohio –, während weit mehr auf a enden, von Alabama und Alaska bis Pennsylvania und Virginia.\n\n"],["=",119],["+","\n| Längste Küste | Alaska | rund 6.640 Meilen (allgemein) |"],["=",116]]}]},
